    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before the turnpike, as early as 1796, about 300 wagons and sleighs passed through the area that would become Westmere.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westmere%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A toll gate once stood on the turnpike near present‑day Highland Estates, marking a historic checkpoint.",
